creatures:
- name: Giant Scorpion
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 15  
      **Hit Points** 52 (rollable(dice=7d10 + 14,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Initiative) (11)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=1)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-5,label=-5,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=9)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=3)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Senses** blindsight 60 ft., Passive Perception 9  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 3 (700 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The scorpion makes two Claw attacks and one Sting attack.

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 13) from one of two claws.

      ***Sting.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Sting]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Sting]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=2d10,dicelabel=Damage [Sting]) Poison damage.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Large Beast, Unaligned*  
    **Challenge** 3
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024giantscorpion
  status: 1

